{
  "name": "zovo-image-editor",
  "displayName": "Image Editor & Image Resizer (Crop, Annotate, Convert)",
  "description": "Image editor and image resizer for VS Code: crop, resize, rotate, straighten, annotate (arrows, boxes, text, numbered steps), blur or pixelate, and convert PNG, JPEG, WebP, GIF and BMP files with Undo, Save and Save As. Works offline, no account.",
  "version": "0.1.0",
  "publisher": "zovo",
  "license": "MIT",
  "icon": "icon.png",
  "galleryBanner": {
    "color": "#1B2A4A",
    "theme": "dark"
  },
  "repository": {
    "type": "git",
    "url": "https://github.com/theluckystrike/image-editor-vscode"
  },
  "bugs": {
    "url": "https://github.com/theluckystrike/image-editor-vscode/issues"
  },
  "homepage": "https://github.com/theluckystrike/image-editor-vscode#readme",
  "engines": {
    "vscode": "^1.90.0"
  },
  "categories": [
    "Visualization",
    "Other"
  ],
  "keywords": [
    "image editor",
    "image resizer",
    "image resize",
    "resize image",
    "image crop",
    "crop image",
    "image annotate",
    "annotate screenshot",
    "screenshot editor",
    "image converter",
    "photo editor",
    "paint",
    "image compress",
    "image compare",
    "png",
    "jpeg",
    "webp",
    "crop",
    "resize",
    "annotate",
    "redact",
    "blur",
    "screenshot",
    "convert",
    "rotate"
  ],
  "main": "./src/extension.js",
  "activationEvents": [],
  "capabilities": {
    "untrustedWorkspaces": {
      "supported": true
    },
    "virtualWorkspaces": true
  },
  "contributes": {
    "customEditors": [
      {
        "viewType": "imageEditor.edit",
        "displayName": "Image Editor",
        "selector": [
          {
            "filenamePattern": "*.png"
          },
          {
            "filenamePattern": "*.jpg"
          },
          {
            "filenamePattern": "*.jpeg"
          },
          {
            "filenamePattern": "*.webp"
          },
          {
            "filenamePattern": "*.bmp"
          },
          {
            "filenamePattern": "*.gif"
          }
        ],
        "priority": "option"
      }
    ],
    "commands": [
      {
        "command": "imageEditor.open",
        "title": "Edit Image",
        "category": "Image Editor",
        "icon": "$(edit)"
      },
      {
        "command": "imageEditor.openSample",
        "title": "Open a sample screenshot",
        "category": "Image Editor"
      },
      {
        "command": "imageEditor.openWalkthrough",
        "title": "Get started",
        "category": "Image Editor"
      },
      {
        "command": "imageEditor.saveAs",
        "title": "Save a copy as PNG, JPEG, WebP or BMP",
        "category": "Image Editor"
      },
      {
        "command": "imageEditor.pasteAsNewFile",
        "title": "Paste an image from the clipboard as a new file",
        "category": "Image Editor"
      },
      {
        "command": "imageEditor.batch",
        "title": "Batch resize and convert a folder (Pro)",
        "category": "Image Editor"
      },
      {
        "command": "imageEditor.compress",
        "title": "Compress to a target size (Pro)",
        "category": "Image Editor"
      },
      {
        "command": "imageEditor.compare",
        "title": "Compare two images (Pro)",
        "category": "Image Editor"
      },
      {
        "command": "imageEditor.supportDeveloper",
        "title": "Support the developer",
        "category": "Image Editor"
      },
      {
        "command": "imageEditor.moreViewers",
        "title": "More free viewers",
        "category": "Image Editor"
      },
      {
        "command": "imageEditor.getPro",
        "title": "Get Zovo Pro (USD 19 once, all 22 Zovo extensions)",
        "category": "Zovo Pro"
      },
      {
        "command": "imageEditor.payWithPayPal",
        "title": "Pay for Zovo Pro with PayPal (USD 19, team of 5 USD 59)",
        "category": "Zovo Pro"
      },
      {
        "command": "imageEditor.unlockWithSponsors",
        "title": "I already paid: unlock with GitHub Sponsors",
        "category": "Zovo Pro"
      },
      {
        "command": "imageEditor.enterLicenseKey",
        "title": "Enter Zovo Pro license key",
        "category": "Zovo Pro"
      },
      {
        "command": "imageEditor.removeLicense",
        "title": "Remove Zovo Pro from this editor",
        "category": "Zovo Pro"
      },
      {
        "command": "imageEditor.payByCard",
        "title": "Pay for Zovo Pro by card (USD 19)",
        "category": "Zovo Pro"
      }
    ],
    "menus": {
      "editor/title": [
        {
          "command": "imageEditor.open",
          "when": "activeCustomEditorId == 'imagePreview.previewEditor'",
          "group": "navigation@10"
        }
      ],
      "explorer/context": [
        {
          "command": "imageEditor.open",
          "when": "!explorerResourceIsFolder && resourceExtname =~ /^\\.(png|jpe?g|webp|bmp|gif)$/i",
          "group": "navigation@40"
        },
        {
          "command": "imageEditor.compare",
          "when": "!explorerResourceIsFolder && config.imageEditor.showProTools && resourceExtname =~ /^\\.(png|jpe?g|webp|bmp|gif)$/i",
          "group": "7_modification@40"
        },
        {
          "command": "imageEditor.compress",
          "when": "config.imageEditor.showProTools && (explorerResourceIsFolder || resourceExtname =~ /^\\.(png|jpe?g|webp|bmp|gif)$/i)",
          "group": "7_modification@41"
        },
        {
          "command": "imageEditor.batch",
          "when": "explorerResourceIsFolder && config.imageEditor.showProTools",
          "group": "7_modification@42"
        }
      ],
      "commandPalette": [
        {
          "command": "imageEditor.batch",
          "when": "config.imageEditor.showProTools"
        },
        {
          "command": "imageEditor.compress",
          "when": "config.imageEditor.showProTools"
        },
        {
          "command": "imageEditor.compare",
          "when": "config.imageEditor.showProTools"
        },
        {
          "command": "imageEditor.saveAs",
          "when": "activeCustomEditorId == 'imageEditor.edit'"
        }
      ]
    },
    "configuration": {
      "title": "Image Editor",
      "properties": {
        "imageEditor.jpegQuality": {
          "type": "number",
          "default": 92,
          "minimum": 1,
          "maximum": 100,
          "description": "JPEG quality (1-100) used when you save a .jpg or .jpeg file."
        },
        "imageEditor.webpQuality": {
          "type": "number",
          "default": 90,
          "minimum": 1,
          "maximum": 100,
          "description": "WebP quality (1-100) used when you save a .webp file."
        },
        "imageEditor.showProTools": {
          "type": "boolean",
          "default": true,
          "description": "Show the Batch resize, Compress and Compare buttons (Zovo Pro tools, 3 free tries each). Turn off to hide them."
        },
        "imageEditor.showSupportLinks": {
          "type": "boolean",
          "default": true,
          "description": "Show the small Rate, More free viewers and support links at the bottom of the editor."
        },
        "imageEditor.askForRating": {
          "type": "boolean",
          "default": true,
          "description": "Ask once, after a few days of use, whether you want to rate the extension. Never after an error."
        }
      }
    },
    "walkthroughs": [
      {
        "id": "imageEditor.start",
        "title": "Image Editor & Image Resizer",
        "description": "Crop, resize, mark up and convert images without leaving VS Code.",
        "steps": [
          {
            "id": "open",
            "title": "Open an image in the editor",
            "description": "Images still open in VS Code's own preview. Click Edit Image at the top right of the preview, or right-click a .png, .jpg, .webp, .gif or .bmp file and pick Edit Image.\n[Open a sample screenshot](command:imageEditor.openSample)\n[Edit an image...](command:imageEditor.open)",
            "media": {
              "markdown": "walkthrough/open.md"
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "markup",
            "title": "Crop, resize and mark up",
            "description": "Crop with a fixed ratio, resize in pixels or percent, add arrows, boxes, text and numbered steps, and blur or pixelate anything private. Undo and Redo work as in any editor.\n[Open a sample screenshot](command:imageEditor.openSample)",
            "media": {
              "markdown": "walkthrough/markup.md"
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "save",
            "title": "Save or convert",
            "description": "Save keeps the format (JPEG and WebP quality are settings). Save As, or Save a copy, writes PNG, JPEG, WebP or BMP.\n[Save a copy as...](command:imageEditor.saveAs)",
            "media": {
              "markdown": "walkthrough/save.md"
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "zovo-related",
            "title": "Files that often come with images",
            "description": "If your project also has SVG images or binary files, these free Zovo extensions open them. A link opens the extension page, and you choose there whether to install it.\n[SVG Viewer](command:extension.open?%5B%22zovo.zovo-svg-viewer%22%5D)\n[Hex Viewer](command:extension.open?%5B%22zovo.zovo-hex-viewer%22%5D)",
            "media": {
              "markdown": "walkthrough/related.md"
            }
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
  "scripts": {
    "test": "node scripts/test.js",
    "samples": "node scripts/make_samples.js"
  },
  "devDependencies": {
    "@types/vscode": "~1.90.0"
  },
  "sponsor": {
    "url": "https://github.com/sponsors/theluckystrike/sponsorships?tier_id=679878"
  }
}
